t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI收紧ChatGPT广告政策，禁止竞品投放AI生图与音频类广告</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Mistral AI完成30亿欧元D轮融资，估值突破210亿欧元创欧洲纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布V4.1 Flash模型并整合智能模式，V4 Pro将于9月14日下线</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Suno v6 正式上线：支持多模态输入与精准局部编辑功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/77255f66b7bdbcf8b20cd8a8b314f1c5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI 音乐生成平台 Suno 正式发布全新一代模型家族 Suno v6，这是其与华纳音乐集团、BMG 及 Believe 等合作伙伴共同开发的首个模型系列。v6 矩阵包含旗舰版 v6、探索版 v6-wild 及高效版 v6-mini，覆盖不同用户需求。该模型核心亮点在于支持多模态输入，用户可将图片、视频或语音备忘录一键转化为音乐。此外，v6 引入了精准局部编辑功能，创作者无需重新生成全曲，即可通过自然语言指令修改特定段落、歌词或混搭不同作品的乐器元素。Suno v6 显著提升了对音乐语言的理解力，能更精准地把握人声、结构与情绪。官方强调，该模型使用授权数据及用户数据训练，禁止生成知名艺术家仿作。目前 v6 已在全球推送，旨在为创作者提供从灵感到成品的高效闭环。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI旗舰模型GPT-6 Astra正式接入亚马逊云科技Amazon Bedrock平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI旗舰模型GPT-6 Astra已正式登陆亚马逊云科技Amazon Bedrock平台，全球企业客户即日起可通过该平台调用此模型。GPT-6 Astra具备极强的泛用性，可深度覆盖财务分析、合同审查等复杂企业级应用场景。为保障企业数据安全，Amazon Bedrock构建了严密防护体系，提供芯片级零运维人员访问及全流程加密功能。平台明确规定，企业推理计算产生的数据严禁用于后续模型训练，且无需与OpenAI共享，实现“用完即走、严格隔离”的运行模式。此举消除了金融、法律等高合规要求行业在采纳大模型时的安全顾虑，标志着顶级LLM在企业级云服务生态中的进一步渗透，为企业AI应用落地提供了更安全、合规的部署选择。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI收紧ChatGPT广告政策，禁止竞品投放AI生图与音频类广告</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近期更新广告政策，明确禁止竞争对手在ChatGPT平台内投放图像生成与音频生成类产品的商业广告。Adobe美洲媒体高级总监Doug Wyatt证实，Adobe此前参与的Firefly AI图像生成器推广活动已受限。此次调整不涉及视频生成工具，但OpenAI同步切断了第三方图片编辑器和图像生成器的自然流量，ChatGPT已停止针对此类操作性查询返回外部引用链接。该政策旨在保护刚推出的ChatGPT Images 2.5模型及ChatGPT Live语音功能。自2026年2月启动广告测试以来，OpenAI广告业务上线不足200天，年化收入运行率已突破10亿美元，全年目标设定为25亿美元。此举意味着第三方开发者在ChatGPT生态内同时失去了付费推广与自然流量获取的两大核心获客渠道。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral AI完成30亿欧元D轮融资，估值突破210亿欧元创欧洲纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">欧洲AI企业Mistral AI正式完成30亿欧元D轮融资，公司估值突破210亿欧元，刷新欧洲科技公司股权融资规模纪录。本轮资金将重点投入大规模模型训练与推理算力扩建，并加速下一代核心技术研发。Hugging Face联合创始人Thomas Wolf评价称，这是全球开源模型构建公司获得的最大规模融资，对开源生态具有重要意义，体现了公司将模型控制权与所有权交还用户的理念。在当前全球大模型赛道向闭源巨头倾斜的背景下，Mistral AI通过此轮融资巩固了欧洲本土核心AI力量地位，将继续在开源路线上保持技术竞争力，为行业多元化与技术普惠提供持续动能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布V4.1 Flash模型并整合智能模式，V4 Pro将于9月14日下线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4befaa55840fa1fc052c06aa0f52589e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek宣布将原有的快速、专家及识图模式合一，推出统一智能模式，支持模型自动检测查询复杂度并激活视觉能力。核心产品DeepSeek-V4.1 Flash模型于2026年9月10日发布，该模型采用新架构，具备原生多模态支持，在性能、速度及成本上全面超越V4 Pro。DeepSeek计划于9月14日12:00正式下线V4 Pro服务，届时请求将自动路由至V4.1 Flash并按新标准计费。同步调整的Flash系列定价显示，空闲时段输入缓存命中单价为0.02元，未命中为1元，输出单价为4元；高峰时段价格翻倍。此前，多模态视觉理解模型DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp已上线API平台，支持Chat Completions、Messages及Responses格式调用。此次更新旨在通过技术迭</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
